# Files that run or are read inside Debian keep LF on every checkout. Git
# for Windows (core.autocrlf=true) otherwise writes them with CRLF:
# installer then no longer matches installer.sha256, and the MSIX built
# from that checkout stops at "The installer file is damaged".
installer        text eol=lf
installer.sha256 text eol=lf
lang/**          text eol=lf
panel/**         text eol=lf
*.sh             text eol=lf
*.bats           text eol=lf
*.py             text eol=lf
